  "status": "Review round 7: faceted launcher bays round the Harpoons, one 30/45 deg angle vocabulary, single nose bend and single anhedral; round 6: no turntables under the Harpoon hardpoints, faceted pointed gun nacelles with angular armour, one bow armour strake a side to the beak, leading-edge arm armour; round 5: Harpoon racks inset in wing wells, faceted tapering engine block, slender V belly, steeper wing droop; round 4: forward hull pitched down from just ahead of the bridge; round 3: drooping beak and wings bending down to their tips (bird of prey); bridge back on a low plinth at the core deck, the Hellbore sunk deeper in a wider pit so the bridge sees over it; round 2 deep faceted lofted hull; pass 6 light pirate livery + pass 4 scale (0.59 m/u, ship_scale.py option C) + pass 2 detail on the pass 1 slots, drives, turret-kit weapons, anchors and running lights.",
